                                        // queries. This handler only ever wrote to news_posts, so
                                        // anything published through THIS form was invisible to that
                                        // log no matter what: app-news.js's own onSnapshot listener on
                                        // news_posts would optimistically insert a row into the admin
                                        // table for it (via _syncAdminTable), but the very next time
                                        // the admin opened/re-opened the Publish tab,
                                        // _refreshNewsTable() re-queried news_articles, found nothing
                                        // for this article, and unconditionally rebuilt the table —
                                        // wiping that optimistic row out. That silent disappearance is
                                        // exactly "immediately after posting, the item is hidden."
                                        // Archiving here too (same shape app-admin.js's form already
                                        // writes, best-effort — a failure here must never block the
