                            // text, it's cutting some of it off -- should hold 220 chars
                            // without cutting any"): baseCardH used to be a FIXED height
                            // (size * 0.42) chosen before the quote text was ever measured,
                            // so a quote long enough to wrap past 5 lines (well within the
                            // composer's own 220-char limit) had its last line chopped and
                            // an ellipsis stamped on -- see the now-removed
                            // maxLinesThatFit/'\u2026' block that used to live inside
                            // finishRest() below. The quote is now measured and wrapped
                            // FIRST, right here, and every layout value that follows
                            // (baseCardH, cardH, cardY, divY, footY) is derived FROM that
                            // real line count instead of the text being forced to fit a
